# PayPal Configuration (PayPal Payments)
# =============================================
# 1. Sign up at: https://developer.paypal.com
# 2. Go to: Dashboard → My Apps & Credentials
# 3. Create App (use Sandbox mode for testing)
# 4. Copy the "Client ID" from Sandbox
# 5. Paste it below (remove the # to uncomment)
